# Baseline of scripts/checks/pin-check.sh (a ratchet: it only shrinks).
# Sources under k8s/base and k8s/components with a remote resource off a tag or commit, a helmChart without an
# exact version, or an image that is untagged or `latest`. Pin one and remove its line in the same PR.
# A new offender fails the check; so does a line here that no longer offends. Regenerate with
# `scripts/checks/repo_checks.py pins --write-baseline` and review the diff: it must only lose lines.
